 173:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_math.c ****   *                   d= alpha *sin(theta)+ beta *cos(Theta)
 174:.sdk/SR5E1_MCTK-1.3.0/src/MotorControl/mc_math.c ****   *                   q= alpha *cos(Theta)- beta *sin(Theta)
